            '["The stripped to credited rate ratio of 5.010020 at 9.5 m/s", "The remaining life of 2.385570 yr at the base velocity of 2.73 m/s", "The computed film onset of 70.007517 C at the base fugacity", "The severe band label on the 1.203067 mm/yr rate"]'::jsonb, 0, 'Both rates share the whole chain, so every constant divides out and the ratio is one over the retained fraction 0.1996.', true);
